{
  "uid": "collection",
  "title": "Collection overview",
  "description": "The catalog: archive pages and documents tracked on uk.wikisource.org, translations and FTP matching. Time panels use the wiki timestamps (when a scan or page last changed on the wiki); widen the time range.",
